        "Content": "13 Shannon Gael, Croghan Road, Carrick-on-Shannon, Co. Leitrim. N41N2H2\r\n\r\nAbbey Property Sales offer this lovely property for sale in Carrick-on-Shannon.\r\n\r\nIf you’re looking for a beautiful, well-finished family home in a convenient and highly sought-after location, this four-bedroom semi-detached property could be just what you’ve been waiting for.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, you’ll appreciate the quality finish and attractive presentation of this lovely home, both inside and out.\r\n\r\nInside, the property offers four spacious bedrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite, providing comfortable accommodation for families, couples or anyone looking for additional space.\r\n\r\nThe home benefits from oil-fired central heating, along with a stove, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout the living areas.\r\n\r\nOne of the highlights of the property is the excellent manicured outdoor space. The rear garden features a beautiful slate patio area, \r\nThere’s also a large garden shed, providing excellent additional storage for garden equipment, tools, bikes and much more.\r\n\r\nLocation is another major attraction.\r\n13 Shannon Gael is conveniently located close to Carrick-on-Shannon Railway Station, making commuting and travelling particularly convenient.\r\nYou’re also just a short distance from all the amenities Carrick-on-Shannon has to offer, including shops, schools, restaurants, cafés, leisure facilities and local services.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re searching for a family home, a first home or a property in a convenient location with excellent amenities on your doorstep, this home has plenty to offer.\r\n\r\nQuality finish. Great space. Excellent location.\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation -\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall. 4.12 m x 2.44 m. bright tiled area with coving.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room. 6.94 m x 4.70 m. tiled floor, lovely cream fitted kitchen with all appliances, coving, patio doors to tiled patio area.\r\n\r\nUtility. 2.40 m x 1.52 m. fitted units with sink, washing machine and dryer, back door.\r\n\r\nSitting Room. 4.81 m x 4.39 m. lovely bright room with fireplace with stove, coving, laminated flooring. built in units.\r\n\r\nWC. 1.47 m x 1.21 m. tiled room with whb & wc.\r\n\r\nLanding. 4.01 m x 1.14 m. plus 2.10 m x 1.26 m. carpeted area.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom. 3.81 m x 3.40 m. bright room with carpet, large window, built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEnsuite. 2.10 m x 1.46 m. tiled room with shower, whb & wc.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2. 4.01 m x 2.46 m. carpeted room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3. 3.95 m x 2.78 m. carpeted room with built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4. 2.89 m x 1.83 m. carpeted.\r\n\r\nBathroom. 2.64 m x 1.70 m. fully tiled room, bath/shower, whb & wc.\r\n\r\nLarge Hotpress.\r\n\r\nGarage. large garage / workshop.\r\n\r\nCall Gerry on 086 8066701 to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge, information & belief. The utmost care and attention on our part has been placed on providing factual and correct information. Please note that in certain instances some information may have been provided directly by the vendor to ourselves. Whilst due attention and care is taken in preparing particulars, this firm does not hold itself responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have."
